# Identity files and key material of a MORPHEUS server. SECURITY.md forbids committing them, and the remote server
# accepts any path for both, this working tree included. RepositoryCredentialHygieneTest holds these lines and refuses
# a tracked file that matches one.
remote-auth*.txt
*.p12
*.jks
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
